WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.169 --> 00:00:02.920
Snoopy!

00:00:02.920 --> 00:00:03.462
-Snoopy!

00:00:03.462 --> 00:00:04.713
Snoopy!

00:00:07.466 --> 00:00:09.927
Keep your eyes on the dog treat.

00:00:13.722 --> 00:00:14.723
Beginner's luck.

00:00:16.183 --> 00:00:17.184
Follow that beagle.

00:00:19.811 --> 00:00:22.814
Your imagination can take you
any place you want to go.

00:00:26.026 --> 00:00:28.654
Why can't my brother have a
normal dog?

00:00:39.206 --> 00:00:41.833
My dog lives a far more
interesting life than I do.

00:00:47.923 --> 00:00:49.633
But Snoopy by my side...

00:00:49.633 --> 00:00:51.176
There is nothing we can't do.

